### PAYMENT SERVICE - AUTHENTICATION & AUTHORIZATION TEST
### Sử dụng file này với REST Client extension trong VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@driverToken = YOUR_DRIVER_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### 1. PUBLIC ENDPOINT - Không cần token
### Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-auth/public
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### 2. PROTECTED ENDPOINT - Không có token
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### Response:
### {
###   "isSuccess": false,
###   "message": "Bạn chưa đăng nhập hoặc token đã hết hạn...",
###   "errorCode": "UnauthorizedError",
###   "value": null
### }
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-auth/protected
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### 3. PROTECTED ENDPOINT - Có token hợp lệ
### Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-auth/protected
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 4. ADMIN ONLY - Token không phải Admin
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
### Response:
### {
###   "isSuccess": false,
###   "message": "Bạn không có quyền truy cập tài nguyên này.",
###   "errorCode": "ForbiddenError",
###   "value": null
### }
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-auth/admin-only
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### ============================================
### 5. ADMIN ONLY - Token của Admin
### Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-auth/admin-only
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================
### 6. INSTRUCTOR OR DRIVER - Token phù hợp
### Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-auth/instructor-or-driver
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### ============================================
### 7. MANUAL 401 - Demo trả lỗi 401 thủ công
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-auth/manual-401
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### 8. MANUAL 403 - Demo trả lỗi 403 thủ công
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-auth/manual-403
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### 9. THROW UNAUTHORIZED - Middleware bắt exception
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-auth/throw-unauthorized
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### 10. THROW ERROR - Middleware bắt exception chung
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-auth/throw-error
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### ACTUAL ENDPOINTS - GET WALLET
### ============================================

### 11. Get Wallet - Không có token
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. Get Wallet - Token hợp lệ (NoviceDriver/Admin/Instructor)
### Expected: 200 OK hoặc tạo wallet mới
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Get Wallet - Token không đúng role
### Expected: 403 Forbidden (nếu role không phải NoviceDriver, Admin, Instructor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer INVALID_ROLE_TOKEN

### ============================================
### ADD BALANCE TO WALLET
### ============================================

### 14. Add Balance - Không cần auth (internal service)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/balance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "balance": 100000
}

### ============================================
### CHECK PAYMENT
### ============================================

### 15. Check Payment - Internal service call
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/check-payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "amount": 50000,
  "bookingId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa7",
  "drivingSessionId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa8"
}

